This page provides a list of the FHIR artifacts defined as part of this implementation guide.


Structures: Logical Models {% capture grouping_desc %}These define data models that represent the domain covered by this implementation guide in more business-friendly terms than the underlying FHIR resources.{% endcapture %}
    {{ grouping_desc | markdownify}}





               Logical model for remote monitoring context in the scope of the VUNS project

            {% capture desc %}This models represents the information extracted from the EHR to contextualize a remote monitoring session in the scope of the VUNS project.{% endcapture %}
{{ desc | markdownify}}





